#: volumefader_plugin.cpp:236
msgid ""
"Normalizes audio by maximizing the volume without distorting the sound.\n"
"\n"
"Parameters:\n"
"  method: 1: use a single sample to smooth the variations via the standard "
"weighted mean over past samples (default); 2: use several samples to smooth "
"the variations via the standard weighted mean over past samples.\n"
msgstr ""
"Normaliza o son maximizando o volume sen distorsionar.\n"
"\n"
"Parámetros:\n"
"  método 1: utiliza unha só mostra para suavizar as variacións mediante a "
"media ponderada sobre as mostras pasadas (predeterminado); 2: utiliza varias "
"mostras para suavizar as variacións mediante a media ponderada sobre as "
"mostras pasadas.\n"

